    "detailed_description": "Step into the heart of 1905 Paris and brace yourself for a bombastic multiplayer extravaganza! Ars\u00e8ne Bomber invites you to a dynamic, action-packed experience where up to 4 players engage in intense battles, testing their wits and strategies in the pursuit of victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay: Customize Your Bomber, Ignite the Fray!</strong></h2>Take control of your own daring Bomber, customize it to your heart's content, and dive headfirst into the chaos. Level up and unlock thrilling new abilities \u2013 stun adversaries with a well-timed punch, shield yourself from fatal explosions, or chase down rivals with remote-controlled bombs. The choice is yours! Play solo for a personal challenge or invite friends to join the chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/778b08c126597fe9ae0e9c76997b8c37.poster.avif?t=1712580258\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/778b08c126597fe9ae0e9c76997b8c37.webm?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/778b08c126597fe9ae0e9c76997b8c37.mp4?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features and Mechanics: Unleash the Bomber Within!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bomberman-inspired gameplay that promises explosive fun<br></li><li>Customize your Bomber with unique abilities<br></li><li>Engage in battles with up to 4 players (local mode) for non-stop action<br></li><li>Face off against AI opponents with adjustable difficulty for solo play<br></li><li>Experience the Revenge UFO Feature in Battle Mode<br></li><li>Enjoy seamless Player Drop-In for uninterrupted, chaotic fun<br></li><li>Play with your keyboard or controllers for a personalized gaming experience<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in 6 thrilling Modes and conquer 8 Stages for maximum fun</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to a Blastastic Adventure with 6 Modes to Ignite Your Fun:</strong></h2><strong>1. Battle Royale Bonanza:</strong><br>Engage in the classic mode where you'll unleash bomb mayhem on all your opponents until you emerge as the ultimate last survivor. Prepare for an explosive showdown!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/d6508b89617c41313bf24090171d617f.poster.avif?t=1712580258\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/d6508b89617c41313bf24090171d617f.webm?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/d6508b89617c41313bf24090171d617f.mp4?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>2. Hot Potato Frenzy:</strong><br>Hold onto your hats (and bombs)! Pass the bomb to another player to dodge the heat, and then make your daring escape. Be the last survivor in this sizzling game of bomb hot potato \u2013 it's bomb-tastic fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/759f6c37157a798a2bfde3887260f8f6.poster.avif?t=1712580258\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/759f6c37157a798a2bfde3887260f8f6.webm?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/759f6c37157a798a2bfde3887260f8f6.mp4?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>3. Coin Grab Extravaganza:</strong><br>Get ready to grab, deposit, and sabotage! Collect coins and secure them in your bank, but watch out \u2013 drop some bombs to blast your opponent's coins before they bank them. The one with the most coins in the bank emerges victorious in this high-stakes coin-collecting showdown!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/79d08ecc0782602144c08d33f594594d.poster.avif?t=1712580258\" width=616 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/79d08ecc0782602144c08d33f594594d.webm?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/79d08ecc0782602144c08d33f594594d.mp4?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>4. Treasure Hunt Delight:</strong><br>Embark on a thrilling adventure to claim the treasure and rack up those points! Guard your loot fiercely because the player with the most points at the end of the hunt is crowned the treasure master. It's a race against time and rivals \u2013 may the best adventurer win!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/e684efdee7db4e31cea9d0bb6795ee1f.poster.avif?t=1712580258\" width=616 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/e684efdee7db4e31cea9d0bb6795ee1f.webm?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/e684efdee7db4e31cea9d0bb6795ee1f.mp4?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>5. Disguise Party Shenanigans:</strong><br>Get ready for a game of wits and disguises! Blend in with the crowd, catch unsuspecting players, and be the last person standing or the one with the most points. It's a party where only the sneakiest survive \u2013 can you outwit your opponents?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/3992f68d4d7a00c20df92cb642d18113.poster.avif?t=1712580258\" width=616 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/3992f68d4d7a00c20df92cb642d18113.webm?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/3992f68d4d7a00c20df92cb642d18113.mp4?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>6. Darkness Invasion Challenge:</strong><br>Survival meets the shadows in this heart-pounding mode. Collect coins, eliminate lurking shadows, and brace yourself for increasing difficulty with each round. How long can you last in the thrilling Darkness Invasion? The shadows await your daring escape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/c48c71ebf47bd63d914fa3d19cd3bfd2.poster.avif?t=1712580258\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/c48c71ebf47bd63d914fa3d19cd3bfd2.webm?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792270/extras/c48c71ebf47bd63d914fa3d19cd3bfd2.mp4?t=1712580258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><i>Get ready for non-stop laughter, strategic chaos, and bombastic moments in Ars\u00e8ne Bomber's 6 explosive modes. Unleash your inner bomber and conquer each mode to become the ultimate champion!</i><br><br><strong><i>Join the explosive hunt in Ars\u00e8ne Bomber and be the ultimate mastermind in this bomb-filled adventure!</i></strong>",
